Hello,

<% if @recipient == @user.email_address %>
<% if @granted %>
Your Clinch account (<%= @user.email_address %>) was just granted
administrator access, via the group "<%= @group_name %>".

You can now manage every user, group and application on this Clinch
instance.
<% else %>
Administrator access was just revoked from your Clinch account
(<%= @user.email_address %>). You were removed from the group
"<%= @group_name %>".
<% end %>
This change was made by <%= @actor_email %>.
<% else %>
<% if @granted %>
<%= @user.email_address %> was just granted administrator access on this
Clinch instance, via the group "<%= @group_name %>".
<% else %>
Administrator access was just revoked from <%= @user.email_address %>,
by removal from the group "<%= @group_name %>".
<% end %>
The change was made by <%= @actor_email %>. You are receiving this
because you are an administrator of this instance.

If this was not expected, review the administrator group membership now —
an unexpected change here means someone can reach every account and every
application behind Clinch.
<% end %>

